"US, FI, DE) an kodek bangê (mînak +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:593
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Dengê ringback dengê ku tê lîstin (toot-toot-toot) dema ku li benda "
"bersivdana bangek derketinê ye. Hin hilgir wê naafirînin ji ber vê yekê me "
"vebijarkek heye ku em li vir bi destan hilberînin. \n"
"\n"
"Hûn dikarin pelê muzîka xwe hilbijêrin, an jî wê paqij bikin ku tone pergala "
"standard bikar bînin."

